00:08:45.877 --> 00:08:47.377
DUSTIN INGRAM: Right
out of the bat,

00:08:47.377 --> 00:08:49.660
putting your Python application,
your web application

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:53.240
on Google Cloud is like one of
