00:26:08.620 --> 00:26:11.230
I'm going to have to try to hit
that up and see if I can find

00:26:11.230 --> 00:26:12.280
something that can't be done.

00:26:12.280 --> 00:26:12.670
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

